    "code": "LogisticRegression()\nLogisticRegression(class_weight=\"balanced\")\nLogisticRegression(class_weight={0: 1, 1: 5})\n\n# \"balanced\" weights here: {0: 0.53, 1: 9.52}",
    "caption": "balanced sets the ratio from class counts; a dict lets you choose it."
